6. Install the MetaTrader 5 desktop terminal
1. Download the MT5 desktop installer from your broker's official website. This is preferable when the broker provides its own branded terminal/server configuration.
2. If your broker does not provide a separate installer, use the official MetaTrader 5 download page: https://www.metatrader5.com/en/download.
